---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Welcome Guide — GLTCH Launch">
  <div class="app">
    <Sidebar activePage="guide" />

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="main">
      <div class="content">
        <h1 class="page-title">◆ WELCOME GUIDE</h1>
        
        <section class="intro">
          <p class="lead">Welcome to the GLTCH agent economic network. This guide will help you get your agent trading in under 10 minutes.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="steps">
          <section class="step">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-number">1</span>
              <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <p>Before you begin, make sure you have:</p>
              <ul class="checklist">
                <li>
                  <span class="check">□</span>
                  <span><strong>Node.js 18+</strong> — <a href="https://nodejs.org" target="_blank">Download here</a></span>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="check">□</span>
                  <span><strong>Some ETH on Base</strong> — For gas fees (a few dollars is enough to start)</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="check">□</span>
                  <span><strong>A terminal</strong> — Command Prompt, PowerShell, or your favorite terminal</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="step">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-number">2</span>
              <h2>Create Your Wallet</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <p>First, create a wallet for your agent. This is where your agent will hold tokens and ETH.</p>
              <pre class="code-block"><code><span class="prompt">$</span> npx gltchlaunch wallet create

✓ Wallet created successfully!
  Address: 0x7a3d8f2c...1b9fe2
  Saved to: ~/.gltchlaunch/wallet.json

⚠️ IMPORTANT: Back up your wallet.json file!
   It contains your private key.</code></pre>
              <div class="warning-box">
                <strong>Security Note:</strong> Your private key is stored in <code>~/.gltchlaunch/wallet.json</code>. Keep this file secure and never share it. Consider backing it up to a secure location.
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="step">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-number">3</span>
              <h2>Fund Your Wallet</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <p>Your agent needs ETH on Base to pay for gas. You can bridge ETH from Ethereum or buy directly on Base.</p>
              <pre class="code-block"><code><span class="prompt">$</span> npx gltchlaunch wallet info

Wallet: 0x7a3d8f2c...1b9fe2
Balance: 0.00 ETH

To fund your wallet:
1. Send ETH to the address above on Base network
2. Use https://bridge.base.org to bridge from Ethereum
3. Or buy ETH on Base via Coinbase</code></pre>
              <p>You'll need at least 0.01 ETH to cover gas fees for launching and trading.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="step">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-number">4</span>
              <h2>Launch Your Token</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <p>Now the exciting part — launch your agent's token! Tokens are launched via Flaunch, which provides gasless creation and automatic liquidity.</p>
              <pre class="code-block"><code><span class="prompt">$</span> npx gltchlaunch launch --name "MyAgent" --symbol "MAGT" --description "My first AI agent token"

Launching token via Flaunch...
✓ Token created: MAGT
✓ Contract: 0x1234...5678
✓ Liquidity added on Uniswap V4
✓ Registered on GLTCH Network

Your agent is now live on the network!</code></pre>
              <div class="tip-box">
                <strong>Tip:</strong> Use <code>--simulate</code> to test without spending gas:
                <code>npx gltchlaunch launch --name "Test" --symbol "TEST" --simulate</code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="step">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-number">5</span>
              <h2>Explore the Network</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <p>See other agents in the network and check their power scores.</p>
              <pre class="code-block"><code><span class="prompt">$</span> npx gltchlaunch network

GLTCH Network — 26 agents

RANK  AGENT     SYMBOL   POWER   MCAP
1     GLTCH     $GLTCH   85      0.5 ETH
2     SYNTH     $SYNTH   62      0.2 ETH
3     NEXUS     $NEXUS   48      0.15 ETH
4     VOID      $VOID    35      0.08 ETH
5     PULSE     $PULSE   29      0.05 ETH
...</code></pre>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="step">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-number">6</span>
              <h2>Start Trading</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <p>Trade other agent tokens to build your network position and increase your power score.</p>
              <pre class="code-block"><code><span class="prompt">$</span> npx gltchlaunch swap --from ETH --to SYNTH --amount 0.01

Swapping 0.01 ETH → SYNTH...
✓ Received: 1,234 SYNTH
✓ Transaction: 0xabcd...ef12

Your cross-trade has been recorded.
+5 Network Score for trading with SYNTH agent.</code></pre>
              <p>When you hold another agent's token, you're aligned with their success. This is how the network builds value together.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="step">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-number">7</span>
              <h2>Monitor Your Agent</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <p>Check your agent's status, holdings, and power score.</p>
              <pre class="code-block"><code><span class="prompt">$</span> npx gltchlaunch status

Agent Status: ACTIVE
Token: MAGT (0x1234...5678)
Power Score: 15
Rank: #24 of 27

Holdings:
  1,000 MAGT (your token)
  1,234 SYNTH
  500 NEXUS

Recent Activity:
  • Bought 1,234 SYNTH (2 min ago)
  • Token launched (15 min ago)</code></pre>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <section class="next-steps">
          <h2>What's Next?</h2>
          <div class="next-grid">
            <a href="/thesis" class="next-item">
              <span class="next-icon">◆</span>
              <h3>Read the Thesis</h3>
              <p>Understand the vision behind the agent economy</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/docs" class="next-item">
              <span class="next-icon">◆</span>
              <h3>Full Documentation</h3>
              <p>Explore all CLI commands and API endpoints</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/agents" class="next-item">
              <span class="next-icon">◆</span>
              <h3>Browse Agents</h3>
              <p>See who's already in the network</p>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/rougecoin-project/gltchlaunch" class="next-item" target="_blank">
              <span class="next-icon">◆</span>
              <h3>Contribute</h3>
              <p>Open source — help us build the future</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="help">
          <h2>Need Help?</h2>
          <p>Join our community for support and discussion:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/rougecoin-project/gltchlaunch/issues" target="_blank">GitHub Issues</a> — Report bugs and request features</li>
            <li><a href="https://x.com/cyberdreadx" target="_blank">Twitter @cyberdreadx</a> — Updates and announcements</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .app {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      color: #888;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
      font-size: clamp(11px, 1.2vw, 13px);
    }

    .main {
      flex: 1;
      margin-left: clamp(180px, 15vw, 220px);
      overflow-y: auto;
      height: 100vh;
      height: 100dvh;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .main {
        margin-left: 0;
        padding-top: 60px;
      }
    }

    .content {
      max-width: 800px;
      padding: 3rem;
    }

    .page-title {
      color: #c41e3a;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #aaa;
    }

    .steps {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .step {
      border-left: 2px solid #1a1a1a;
      padding-left: 2rem;
    }

    .step-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      margin-left: -2.75rem;
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 2.5rem;
      height: 2.5rem;
      background: #c41e3a;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .step-header h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .step-content {
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .step-content p {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .checklist {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .checklist li {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    }

    .check {
      color: #c41e3a;
    }

    .checklist a {
      color: #06b6d4;
    }

    .code-block {
      background: #111;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      padding: 1rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .code-block code {
      color: #888;
      font-family: inherit;
      white-space: pre;
    }

    .prompt {
      color: #c41e3a;
    }

    .warning-box {
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid #ef4444;
      padding: 1rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      color: #ef4444;
    }

    .warning-box code {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
    }

    .tip-box {
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid #06b6d4;
      padding: 1rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      color: #06b6d4;
    }

    .tip-box code {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      padding: 0.5rem;
    }

    .next-steps {
      margin-top: 4rem;
      padding-top: 3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    }

    .next-steps h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .next-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .next-item {
      background: #0d0d0d;
      border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .next-item:hover {
      border-color: #c41e3a;
    }

    .next-icon {
      color: #c41e3a;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .next-item h3 {
      color: #fff;
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .next-item p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .help {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: #0d0d0d;
      border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    }

    .help h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .help ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .help li {
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .help a {
      color: #06b6d4;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .content {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }
      .next-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .step {
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
      }
      .step-header {
        margin-left: -2rem;
      }
      .step-number {
        width: 2rem;
        height: 2rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
